<title>USA: W.H. Brady names Jaehnert CFO.</title>
<headline>W.H. Brady names Jaehnert CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>W.H. Brady Co said Tuesday it had named Frank Jaehnert as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Jaehnert has served as finance director for Brady's Identification Systems and Specialty Tapes Group since 1995. He will be responsible for finance, treasury, tax and audit functions of the company.</p>
<p>He succeeds Donald DeLuca, who left the company to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
